isk_level":"medium","coins":[],"event_risk":0.3333333333333333,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"US Stocks Bled as Huang’s Departure From Nvidia Rattles Investors","summary":"The US stock market faced immense pressure through the end of trading on November 13 as tech-market concerns, fueled by Huang’s departure from Nvidia, continued to weigh on sentiment. Tech-heavy indexes took the biggest hit, adding to the recent streak of losses amid growing jitters over AI valuations. Ad Ad US Stocks Dumped on Friday The post US Stocks Bled as Huang’s Departure From Nvidia Rattles Investors appeared first on CoinGape .","link":"https://coingape.com/us-stocks-bled-as-huangs-departure-from-nvidia-rattles-investors/","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:08:15 +0000","published_ts":1794654495.0,"source":"CoinGape","category":"crypto","credibility":0.7,"sentiment":0.0,"direction":"neutral","confidence":0.545,"impact_score":8.4,"risk_level":"low","coins":[],"event_risk":0.0,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"SpaceX not being honest about ‘political’ reasons for slowing Starshield, says Zelenskyy","summary":"Throttling of Elon Musk’s military-grade satellite system affecting whole frontline, says Ukraine’s president Volodymyr Zelenskyy has accused SpaceX of not telling the truth over restrictions to Ukraine’s Starshield satellite system , saying the decision to impose speed limits appears to be “political” rather than “technical”. Speaking on Friday, Ukraine’s president said the restrictions affecting Ukrainian drones had been in place for five days. They could no longer fly at speeds of more than 161km/h (100mph), he said, with connections at higher speeds lost. Continue reading...","link":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/14/spacex-not-honest-slowing-starshield-elon-musk-volodymyr-zelenskyy","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:05:33 GMT","published_ts":1794654333.0,"source":"The Guardian World","category":"world","credibility":0.9,"sentiment":0.0,"direction":"neutral","confidence":0.615,"impact_score":10.8,"risk_level":"low","coins":[],"event_risk":0.0,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"‘We must deliver’: jubilant Democrats gather in Denver to chart way forward","summary":"At party’s ‘What’s Next’ conference, consensus is they need to act quickly, but over affordability or accountability is the question What’s next for Democrats? It’s the question thousands of Democrats, including lawmakers, strategists, pollsters, creators, organizers, staffers and 2028 presidential hopefuls are trying to answer at a three-day gathering in Denver, after a sweeping victory in the 2026 midterm elections. Continue reading...","link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/14/democrats-denver-whats-next-conference","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:00:44 GMT","published_ts":1794654044.0,"source":"The Guardian World","category":"world","credibility":0.9,"sentiment":0.0,"direction":"neutral","confidence":0.615,"impact_score":22.8,"risk_level":"medium","coins":[],"event_risk":0.3333333333333333,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"Greenpeace boulders may delay building of £12bn windfarms in North Sea","summary":"Activists dumped rocks off Norfolk coast on site of Burnham-backed project in protest against seabed trawling The giant offshore windfarms backed by Andy Burnham this week may face unexpected stumbling blocks after Greenpeace activists unwittingly dumped about 15 tonnes of boulders on to the site as part of a campaign against seabed trawling in the North Sea. Greenpeace created the “boulder barrier” to safeguard harbour porpoises off the Norfolk coast by dropping giant stone blocks, each weighing up to 2 tonnes, on to the sea floor to prevent a method of fishing known as bottom trawling. Continue reading...","link":"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/nov/14/greenpeace-boulders-norfolk-vanguard-windfarms","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:00:43 GMT","published_ts":1794654043.0,"source":"The Guardian World","category":"world","credibility":0.9,"sentiment":0.5773502691896258,"direction":"positive","confidence":0.975,"impact_score":38.5,"risk_level":"low","coins":[],"event_risk":0.0,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"Torture survivors may have been sent to Sussex asylum camp unlawfully, documentary reveals","summary":"Undercover ITV report also shows inadequate welfare checks at ex-military base run by firm of asylum camp billionaire Graham King Asylum seekers accommodated at a controversial military base in East Sussex have been subjected to inadequate welfare checks, and torture survivors may have been placed there unlawfully, a new undercover documentary for ITV has revealed. Mass accommodation sites are central to the government’s plan to end the use of hotels to house asylum seekers. For the documentary Inside The Asylum Camp, ITV’s undercover reporter got a job as a welfare officer at Crowborough and covertly filmed inside the former military training camp. The documentary claims that poor screening and welfare checks are having serious consequences for some of the asylum seekers. Continue reading...","link":"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/14/asylum-seekers-crowborough-torture-survivors-military-camp","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:00:43 GMT","published_ts":1794654043.0,"source":"The Guardian World","category":"world","credibility":0.9,"sentiment":0.0,"direction":"neutral","confidence":0.615,"impact_score":10.8,"risk_level":"low","coins":[],"event_risk":0.0,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"Will Trump’s lame duck presidency push him further beyond constraints of the law?","summary":"Midterm elections have defanged the US president – leaving critics to worry about his next move in his ‘fat Elvis’ stage It was just before 3am when Donald Trump entered a crowded Manhattan ballroom, greeted by chants of “USA! USA” and theme music from the Hollywood film Air Force One. On stage, two red “Make America great again” (Maga) caps were mounted in glass cases like holy relics. That was the scene 10 years ago this week when Trump, a businessman and reality TV star, stunned the world by beating Hillary Clinton to the White House. A decade later an unlikely president is serving an unlikely second term. But in the wake of a humiliating vote of no confidence in last week’s midterm elections , he now enters an endgame wracked with uncertainty. Continue reading...","link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ng-interactive/2026/nov/14/trump-lame-duck-presidency-outcome","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:00:43 GMT","published_ts":1794654043.0,"source":"The Guardian World","category":"world","credibility":0.9,"sentiment":1.0,"direction":"positive","confidence":0.855,"impact_score":58.8,"risk_level":"low","coins":[],"event_risk":0.0,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"Ukraine, Russia race to build military satellite networks as war rages on","summary":"Kyiv seeks to break reliance on Starlink as Moscow develops its own satellite constellation for military communications.","link":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/14/ukraine-russia-race-to-build-military-satellite-networks-as-war-rages-on?traffic_source=rss","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:00:39 +0000","published_ts":1794654039.0,"source":"Al Jazeera","category":"world","credibility":0.9,"sentiment":0.0,"direction":"neutral","confidence":0.615,"impact_score":22.8,"risk_level":"medium","coins":[],"event_risk":0.3333333333333333,"urgency":0.0},{"title":"Latest news bulletin | November 14th, 2026 – Midday","summary":"Catch up with the most important stories from around Europe and beyond this November 14th, 2026 - latest news, breaking news, World, Business, Entertainment, Politics, Culture, Travel.","link":"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/14/latest-news-bulletin-november-14th-2026-midday","published":"Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:00:15 +0100","published_ts":1794654015.0,"source":"Euronews","category":"world","credibility":0.85,"sentiment":0.0,"direction":"neutral","confidence":0.597,"impact_score":18.2,"risk_level":"low","coins":[],"event_risk":0.0,"urgency":0.5},{"title":"NVIDIA Stock 